	"Author": "Robokit12",
	"Description": "OUTDATED MOD! Please note! I don´t plan on modding anymore. But if someone feels like it don't hesitate to change/update and reupload any of my files. I wouldn´t mind it.\n<br />\n<br />Just for fun :D!\n<br />\n<br />Your new pet awaits you at Robins Carpenter Shop (also available via Furniture Catalogue).\n<br />\n<br />Because some of you asked for more variation I´ve added 5 new color options. They can be downloaded separately.\n<br />\n<br />A DGA version converted by\u00A0[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/users/124850573]NOAV7[/url]\u00A0can be found\u00A0[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/16538]here[/url].\n<br />\n<br />[b]\n<br />[/b][b]Installation:\u00A0[/b]Just download the file and extract it to your mod folder.\n<br />\n<br />Please note that items may conflict with other installed custom furniture if those were created with Platonymous Custom Furniture Mod! If this happens just open the FrogTerrarium.json file and change the \"id\" number to something else that isn´t used yet (e.g. 11 to 111 ).\n<br />[b]\u00A0\n<br />Created with:[/b]\n<br />\n<br />[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/1254]Custom Furniture Mod by Platonymous\n<br />\n<br />[/url][b]Requires:[/b]\n<br />\n<br />SMAPI\n<br />Content Patcher\u00A0\n<br />Space Core\n<br />JsonAssets\n<br />Custom Furniture Mod\n<br />PyTK\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />Hope you enjoy :)!",
